# Phase Gates — Legacy Reference

Phase gates are deprecated. New and migrated OpenSpec changes must use vertical slices from `.cursor/rules/vertical-slices.mdc`.

Use this file only when reading old `tasks.md` artifacts that still contain:

- `# Фаза N`
- `<!-- phase-gate: ... -->`
- P0-P4 phase terminology

## Current Behavior

- Do not create new phase-gate tasks.
- Do not emit `missing-phase-gate` for new changes.
- If a legacy `tasks.md` contains phase gates, recommend `/opsx:migrate-slices <change-name>`.
- Backward compatibility logic belongs in verify/migration skills, not in always-on rules.

## Replacement

| Legacy concept | Replacement |
|---|---|
| `# Фаза N` | `# Срез S<N>` |
| `<!-- phase-gate -->` | `<!-- slice-gate -->` |
| P0-P4 order | Scenario-oriented slice dependencies |
| Phase-transition verify | Slice-pre / slice-post / slice-transition verify |

Canonical source: `.cursor/rules/vertical-slices.mdc`.
